From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 16:49:23 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 09/14] wallet(v2): build legacy version 2 transactions
 explicitly

CWallet holds legacy coins and signs them with legacy signatures, so its
transactions are legacy version 2. Set the version explicitly instead of
relying on CMutableTransaction's default.

The migratetov2 RPC of the design (sweeping legacy P2PKH/P2SH coins into a
v7 transaction through bridge signatures) is deferred: it needs a C++
bridge signature creator, V2 output construction and fee estimation for
bridge witnesses in the legacy wallet, which is larger than this
workstream's minimal wallet scope (Q7).

Test: wallet_tests/wallet_creates_legacy_v2_transactions.

Tier: V2
---
 src/wallet/spend.cpp             |  4 ++++
 src/wallet/test/wallet_tests.cpp | 12 ++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 16 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/wallet/spend.cpp b/src/wallet/spend.cpp
index eb208d02ae..bacd012d31 100644
--- a/src/wallet/spend.cpp
+++ b/src/wallet/spend.cpp
@@ -650,6 +650,10 @@ static util::Result<CreatedTransactionResult> CreateTransactionInternal(
     CTransactionRef tx;
     {
         CMutableTransaction txNew;
+        // The wallet signs legacy coins with legacy signatures, so it builds
+        // legacy (version 2) transactions; V2 outputs are spent by the V2
+        // wallet.
+        txNew.nVersion = 2;
         std::set<CInputCoin> setCoins;
         LOCK(wallet.cs_wallet);
         // Previously the locktime was set to the current block height, to
diff --git a/src/wallet/test/wallet_tests.cpp b/src/wallet/test/wallet_tests.cpp
index 5e5f0a1aea..74633f55f3 100644
--- a/src/wallet/test/wallet_tests.cpp
+++ b/src/wallet/test/wallet_tests.cpp
@@ -656,6 +656,18 @@ public:
     std::unique_ptr<CWallet> wallet;
 };
 
+// The wallet creates legacy version 2 transactions paying legacy outputs.
+BOOST_FIXTURE_TEST_CASE(wallet_creates_legacy_v2_transactions,
+                        ListCoinsTestingSetup) {
+    const CWalletTx &wtx =
+        AddTx(CRecipient{GetScriptForRawPubKey({}), 1 * COIN,
+                         false /* subtract fee */});
+    BOOST_CHECK_EQUAL(wtx.tx->nVersion, 2);
+    for (const CTxOut &out : wtx.tx->vout) {
+        BOOST_CHECK(out.IsLegacy());
+    }
+}
+
 BOOST_FIXTURE_TEST_CASE(ListCoinsTest, ListCoinsTestingSetup) {
